Maintainer: corrodedHash <corrodedHash@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: GPG archive key for the weather-pi apt repository
 Ships the public key used to verify the signed InRelease metadata of the
 weather-pi package repository. Install a newer version of this package to
 rotate the archive key without reflashing the device.
